Outer loop vectorization (and unrolling) should occur in this case thanks to
the injection of the implicit barriers to the originally unbarriered kernel
loop and handling the b-loop structure with its iteration variable as
"pure uniform".

The accumulator should end up in the WI context, one accumulator is
maintained for each WI in parallel.

CHECK: %.acc.{{.*}}wi_context.{{.*}} = alloca
CHECK-NOT: %.{{.*}}wi_context.{{.*}} = alloca

CHECK: load <8 x float>

CHECK: llvm.fmuladd.v8f32

CHECK: store <8 x float>

